## API Location Map — Vị trí chính xác các API

Dùng bảng này để tra cứu nhanh khi cần kiểm tra hoặc đồng bộ SDK với handler.

### Handler Location (api-player)

```
apps/api-player/src/handlers/{game}/{action}.ts
```

| Game | Handler dir |
|---|---|
| Keno | `apps/api-player/src/handlers/keno/` |
| Lotto 5/35 | `apps/api-player/src/handlers/lotto535/` |
| Mega 6/45 | `apps/api-player/src/handlers/mega645/` |
| Power 6/55 | `apps/api-player/src/handlers/power655/` |
| Max 3D | `apps/api-player/src/handlers/max3d/` |
| Max 3D Pro | `apps/api-player/src/handlers/max3dpro/` |
| Bingo 18 | `apps/api-player/src/handlers/bingo18/` |

**Action files (đặt tên chuẩn):**
- `place-bet.ts` — POST bets
- `get-game-config.ts` — GET config
- `get-current-draw.ts` — GET draws/current
- `get-jackpot.ts` — GET jackpot (nếu có)
- `list-pending-tickets.ts` — GET tickets/pending
- `list-tickets.ts` — GET tickets
- `get-ticket-entries.ts` — GET tickets/{id}/entries
- `get-entry-lines.ts` — GET entries/{id}/lines (nếu có)
- `list-draw-results.ts` — GET draw-results
- `get-draw-result.ts` — GET draw-results/{drawId}

### DTO Location (use-case layer)

Input/output DTO của từng game:
```
packages/game-{game}-application/src/use-cases/player/dto/player.dto.ts
```

| Game | DTO file |
|---|---|
| Keno | `packages/game-keno-application/src/use-cases/player/dto/player.dto.ts` |
| Lotto 5/35 | `packages/game-lotto535-application/src/use-cases/player/dto/player.dto.ts` |
| Mega 6/45 | `packages/game-mega645-application/src/use-cases/player/dto/player.dto.ts` |
| Power 6/55 | `packages/game-power655-application/src/use-cases/player/dto/player.dto.ts` |
| Max 3D | `packages/game-max3d-application/src/use-cases/player/dto/player.dto.ts` |
| Max 3D Pro | `packages/game-max3dpro-application/src/use-cases/player/dto/player.dto.ts` |
| Bingo 18 | `packages/game-bingo18-application/src/use-cases/player/dto/player.dto.ts` |

### SDK Source Location

```
packages/player-sdk/src/
├── endpoints.ts              ← URL paths registry cho toàn bộ API
├── index.ts                  ← Main exports cho @megawin/player-sdk
├── client.ts                 ← createPlayerClient factory
├── apis/{game}.ts            ← {Game}Api interface + create{Game}Api factory
└── {game}/
    ├── enums.ts              ← PlayType, PrizeTier enums
    ├── types.ts              ← Domain interfaces (input/response)
    └── index.ts              ← export * from "./enums"; export * from "./types"
```

### Quy trình đồng bộ SDK ↔ Handler

Khi có thay đổi ở handler:

1. **Đọc handler** `apps/api-player/src/handlers/{game}/{action}.ts` — xem Zod schema input/output
2. **Đọc DTO** `packages/game-{game}-application/src/use-cases/player/dto/player.dto.ts` — xem output type chính xác
3. **Cập nhật** `packages/player-sdk/src/{game}/types.ts` và `packages/player-sdk/src/apis/{game}.ts`
4. **Cập nhật** `packages/player-sdk/src/endpoints.ts` nếu có path mới
5. **Cập nhật** `packages/player-sdk/src/index.ts` nếu có type mới cần export
6. **Ghi changelog** `packages/player-sdk/CHANGELOG.md`
7. **Bump version** `packages/player-sdk/package.json`
8. **Verify**: `pnpm --filter @megawin/player-sdk check-types`

